      "side": 1,
      "message": "can we store the duplicate of the 1st byte / 4 bytes (per the list above) of tpm objects unencrypted before the actual object to avoid the need to decrypt when checking if it\u0027s the same object? or does that make us susceptible to some form of attack?",
