        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-29T00:21:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought about it, and decided against it: we want to be able to verify the object before comparing, and we can\u0027t verify before decryption.\n\nWe could calculate hash value after encrypting, but I also was not sure if exposing the indices is not a security issue, so I decided to play it safe.",
