      },
      "lineNbr": 959,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-01T22:41:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "how would you suggest we check that? Right now we are checking that there are 4 banks and 64 PCRs (that is indices are in 0..15 range). \n\nDo you foresee a change in the reserved memory layout where more PCRs will be saved?",
      "parentUuid": "0f343152_af2221a4",
