      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-28T05:57:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "shall each line be under ifdef TPM_ALG_xxx and the list include sm3_256?\n\n#ifdef TPM_ALG_SHA1\n  {offsetof(PCR_SAVE, sha1), SHA1_DIGEST_SIZE},\n#endif",
