      "lineNbr": 978,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-29T00:21:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we would ever change the number of supported algorithms on the fly - this would wreck chaos with the reserved objects structure, this is why I did not care about it here.\n\nIf we ever do, we\u0027d need to change the nvmem layout version, and take care of the transition.",
