        "filename": "common/new_nvmem.c",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 1989,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-29T00:21:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the presence of the non-finalized delimiter tells us tht the transaction was completed, but it is possible that earlier instances of the objects present in the last transaction were not deleted. \n\nSo verify_last_section() will look for duplicates of the objects found above the previous delimiter, and if there are any - will remove the earlier instance of these duplicates.\n\nIt will not wipe out everything. Or did I misunderstand the comment?",
      "parentUuid": "86296a9f_cab3897b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1989,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 1989,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "961d2908006ae1ddeb4728590806a583c8640a8c",
